<title>AUSTRALIA: Emperor, Gippsland in Russian j/v.</title>
<headline>Emperor, Gippsland in Russian j/v.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gippsland Resources Australia NL and Fiji gold miner Emperor Mines Ltd said on Wednesday they had entered into a heads of agreement to evaluate gold deposits in Russia.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Emperor will take up a 50 percent interest in unlisted Gippsland subsidiary, PacRim Gold, which will become the operating company for the projects under consideration.</p>
<p>&quot;It will combine Gippsland's detailed knowledge of the Russian gold industry with Emperor's considerable expertise in mining large scale epithermal gold deposits,&quot; Gippsland chairman John Telford said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
